{
  "name": "MAVILERA: GPU Laboratory",
  "short_name": "MAVILERA",
  "description": "A SIMT core of RISC-V threads in warps (two warps of four lanes, or one of eight), with an active mask, a reconvergence stack, split and join, and barriers, drawn cycle by cycle; models of data-parallel machines; practice exercises; a CPU + GPU system with the core on the RISC-V Laboratory's bus. A seven-instruction micro-ISA is kept as an introduction.",
